# Build inputs pinned for reproducible packages: the container images by digest (the
# multi-arch index, so any architecture resolves to the same image), rustup-init by
# version and checksum, and the Flatpak SDK, Platform and Rust extension by commit.
# Sourced by scripts/dist/*.sh and ci/setup.sh. Update deliberately, with
# scripts/dist/update-pins.sh, and rebuild; the GITWEFT_*_IMAGE variables still override.
